    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A woman who bargained with the Devil Beleth for power. Thanks to Beleth' teaching, she gained the power of a powerful mystic. Now, she searches for Beleth' historical site supposedly hidden somewhere underground in the south Gludio Wasteland, and prepares a secret ritual to resurrect him. Demons Lv. 9 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Demons. M. Atk. +10 Atk. Spd. +5% Vampiric Rage effect +1% Bow Skill Vampiric Rage effect +2% Resistance to Dark +10% P. Def. -5% Resistance to Holy -10% Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% Dark Attack Lv. 1 Unleashes a dark attack. Dark Attack Resistance Lv. 5 Resistant to Dark attacks. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
